<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Session Transcript</title>
    <style></style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Session Transcript</h1>
        <p class="session-id">Session ID: <code>example-log</code></p>
    </header>
    <main>
        <p class="lm-note"><strong>Time zone:</strong> UTC, assumed for every logged wall time; the log records no zone.</p>
        <p class="lm-note"><strong>Request attribution unknown:</strong> the log does not record which request produced a logged response, warning or error, so none is shown as a request&#39;s output.</p>
        <section class="message lm-request">
            <div class="message-header">
                <span class="icon">📨</span>
                <span class="message-role">Request <code>POST /v1/chat/completions</code></span>
            </div>
            <div class="message-content">
                <p class="lm-meta">lines 12-20 · 2026-03-03T10:00:03Z (assumed UTC) · model <code>example-model-a</code> · singleton session (no valid thread ID)</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="message user">
            <div class="message-header">
                <span class="icon">👤</span>
                <span class="message-role">User</span>
            </div>
            <div class="message-content">
                <p>First question.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <details class="tool-collapsible lm-event">
            <summary><span class="icon">🤖</span> Unattributed · response · line 21 · 2026-03-03T10:00:04Z (assumed UTC) · model <code>example-model-a</code></summary>
            <div class="tool-content">
                <div class="markdown-content">
<p>First answer.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </details>
        <p class="lm-note">⚠️ <strong>Unsupported endpoint</strong> · <code>POST /v1/decisions</code> · line 36 · 2026-03-03T10:00:05Z (assumed UTC)</p>
        <p class="lm-note">⚠️ <strong>Unsupported endpoint</strong> · <code>POST /v2/future/endpoint</code> · line 40 · 2026-03-03T10:00:06Z (assumed UTC)</p>
        <p class="lm-note">⚠️ <strong>Unsupported endpoint</strong> · <code>POST /v1/decisions</code> · line 41 · 2026-03-03T10:00:07Z (assumed UTC)</p>
        <details class="tool-collapsible lm-event">
            <summary><span class="icon">⚠️</span> Unattributed · WARN · line 46 · 2026-03-03T10:00:09Z (assumed UTC)</summary>
            <div class="tool-content">
                <pre><code>Received request: POST to /v1/responses/input_tokens with body {
  &#34;model&#34;: &#34;example-model-a&#34;,
  &#34;input&#34;: &#34;Count these.&#34;
}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </details>
        <details class="tool-collapsible lm-event">
            <summary><span class="icon">⚠️</span> Unattributed · WARN · line 54 · 2026-03-03T10:00:11Z (assumed UTC) · model <code>example-model-a</code></summary>
            <div class="tool-content">
                <pre><code>Field &#39;logprobs&#39; is not supported and will be ignored.</code></pre>
            </div>
        </details>
        <details class="tool-collapsible lm-event error">
            <summary><span class="icon">❌</span> Unattributed · ERROR · line 55 · 2026-03-03T10:00:12Z (assumed UTC) · model <code>example-model-a</code></summary>
            <div class="tool-content">
                <pre><code>Model crashed while generating.
Continuation of the error report.</code></pre>
            </div>
        </details>
    </main>
<script>
(function() {
    var fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, {
        day: 'numeric', month: 'short', year: 'numeric',
        hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit'
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('time[datetime]').forEach(function(el) {
        var d = new Date(el.getAttribute('datetime'));
        if (!isNaN(d)) el.textContent = fmt.format(d);
    });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
